== Logical Plan ==
Limit: 2
  Sort: [#id DESC]
    Project: [#id, #amount]
      Filter: (#amount >= 22)
        Scan: sales

== Optimized Logical Plan ==
Limit: 2
  Sort: [#id DESC]
    Project: [#id, #amount]
      Scan: sales projection=["sales.amount", "sales.id"] filters=[(#amount >= 22)]

== Physical Plan ==
TopKExec#0: limit=2 sort=[#id DESC]
  ProjectionExec#1: [#id, #amount]
    Parquet/Csv/MemoryScanExec#2: sales partitions=1 projection=Some([3, 0]) filters=[(#amount >= 22)]
